+++ b/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# shop
+
+A small online shop service: customers place orders, pay, and get them delivered.
+
+## Orders
+
+An order starts `created`. Paying it makes it `paid`; it is then `shipped` and finally `delivered`.
+A paid order can be cancelled before it ships, and an hourly job refunds paid orders not shipped
+within `shipWithinDays`; both make it `refunded`.
+
+## Delivery
+
+Delivery costs `deliveryBase` plus `deliveryPerKg` for every started kilogram, up to `maxDelivery`.
+Amounts are in cents. `GET /customers/:id/refunds` lists a customer's refunds.
+
+## Configuration
+
+`config/default.json` holds the defaults; `config/<APP_ENV>.json` overrides them per environment.
